  "title": {
    "en": "Digiroad road and street database, K-format, Shape, 2022, 1:10 000"
  },
  "description": {
    "en": "Digiroad is a national roads and streets database. It is designed to support different kind of transport systems and it is updated by municipalities (attribute data) and National Land Survey (geometry). Digiroad contains all streets and public, private and forest roads. Digiroad includes data about road names and numbers, road width and cover, number of lines, speed limits, bridges and tunnels, parking houses and areas, forbidden turns, addresses etc. \n\nDigiroad 2022 is available both in Shape and GeoPackage formats, in Shape format the data has been divided ti files according to counties.\n\nDigiroad homepage, where you can also download the latest Digiroad data: https://www.digiroad.fi\n\nCoordinate Reference System: ETRS89 / ETRS-TM35FIN (EPSG:3067)"
  },
